msgid "ReliefTodo"
msgstr "ReliefTodo"

msgid ""
"ReliefTodo 是 ReliefOS 的原生 C++17 / FLTK 离线任务管理器。启动命令为 ``relieftodo "
"[list.rtodo]``。使用与 ReliefWord、ReliefExcel 相同的 FLTK 默认 ``gtk+`` "
"主题和中文字体，顶部为文件菜单与功能区，下面为筛选、任务表、任务详情三栏。"
msgstr ""
"ReliefTodo is ReliefOS's native C++17 / FLTK offline task manager, launched "
"with ``relieftodo [list.rtodo]``. It uses the same default FLTK ``gtk+`` "
"theme and Chinese fonts as ReliefWord and ReliefExcel. A File menu and "
"ribbon sit above three panes for filters, the task table, and task details."

msgid "任务与操作"
msgstr "Tasks and Operations"

msgid "任务包含标题、备注、项目、标签、四级优先级、截止日期和完成状态。"
msgstr ""
"Tasks contain a title, notes, project, tags, four priority levels, due date,"
" and completion state."

msgid "新建、复制、删除、完成、恢复、手工移动；Ctrl / Shift 多选，功能区支持批量操作。"
msgstr ""
"Create, duplicate, delete, complete, restore, or manually move tasks. Ctrl /"
" Shift selects multiple tasks, and the ribbon supports batch operations."

msgid ""
"全部、待办、今天、即将到期、已逾期、已完成筛选，可叠加项目和文字搜索。 “即将到期”包括所有晚于今天的未完成任务。搜索覆盖标题、备注、项目和标签； "
"中文按原文匹配，ASCII 字母不区分大小写。"
msgstr ""
"Filters include All, Pending, Today, Upcoming, Overdue, and Completed, "
"combined with project and text search. Upcoming includes all unfinished "
"tasks due after today. Search covers titles, notes, projects, and tags; "
"Chinese matches literally and ASCII letters are case-insensitive."

msgid "按手工顺序、优先级、截止日期、最近更新、标题排序；统计显示总数、完成、逾期和优先级。"
msgstr ""
"Sort by manual order, priority, due date, last update, or title; statistics "
"show totals, completed, overdue, and priorities."

msgid ""
"详情栏编辑当前任务；点击“应用修改”或按 Ctrl+Enter 提交。 切换任务或执行操作时会先提交有效修改，无效日期或空标题会保留输入并提示。"
msgstr ""
"Edit the current task in Details, then click Apply Changes or Ctrl+Enter. "
"Switching tasks or executing operations first commits valid edits; an "
"invalid date or empty title preserves input and shows a message."

msgid ""
"撤销与重做覆盖任务修改、排序、批量操作和清单重命名。最多保存 40 份历史快照， 历史占用按 64 MiB "
"预算裁减，单份快照保留。关闭前询问未保存修改。"
msgstr ""
"Undo/redo covers task edits, sorting, batch operations, and list renaming. "
"Up to 40 history snapshots are kept, trimmed to a 64 MiB history budget "
"while retaining a single snapshot. Unsaved changes prompt before closing."

msgid "首次启动显示示例清单；可从文件菜单新建空白清单或重新载入示例。"
msgstr ""
"The first launch shows a sample list. Create a blank list or reload the "
"sample from the File menu."

msgid "文件与快捷键"
msgstr "Files and Shortcuts"

msgid ""
"``.rtodo`` 是可编辑的原生文档，包含完整任务字段。CSV（UTF-8 BOM）和 Markdown 导出全部任务，不受当前筛选影响。CSV "
"正确转义引号、换行，并保护以公式字符开头的内容。 导出文件不能覆盖当前原生文档，检查包括 ``.``、重复斜线等路径别名，以及同一文件的硬链接。 对 "
"inode 可能由路径生成的文件系统还会核对完整内容，保守拒绝覆盖内容相同的清单副本。"
msgstr ""
"``.rtodo`` is the editable native document containing all task fields. CSV "
"(UTF-8 BOM) and Markdown export all tasks regardless of current filters. CSV"
" correctly escapes quotes/newlines and protects content beginning with "
"formula characters. Exports cannot overwrite the current native document; "
"checks cover path aliases such as ``.`` and repeated slashes, plus hard "
"links to the same file. On filesystems whose inode values may derive from "
"paths, full contents are also compared, conservatively rejecting overwrites "
"of identical list copies."

msgid "快捷键：Ctrl+N / Ctrl+O; 操作：新建清单 / 打开"
msgstr "Shortcut: Ctrl+N / Ctrl+O; Action: New List / Open"

msgid "快捷键：Ctrl+S / Ctrl+Shift+S; 操作：保存 / 另存为"
msgstr "Shortcut: Ctrl+S / Ctrl+Shift+S; Action: Save / Save As"

msgid "快捷键：Ctrl+Insert; 操作：新建任务"
msgstr "Shortcut: Ctrl+Insert; Action: New Task"

msgid "快捷键：Ctrl+Enter; 操作：应用详情修改"
msgstr "Shortcut: Ctrl+Enter; Action: Apply Detail Changes"

msgid "快捷键：Ctrl+F; 操作：搜索"
msgstr "Shortcut: Ctrl+F; Action: Search"

msgid "快捷键：Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Y; 操作：撤销 / 重做（文本输入控件先处理自己的编辑快捷键）"
msgstr ""
"Shortcut: Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Y; Action: Undo / Redo (text inputs handle their own"
" editing shortcuts first)"

msgid "快捷键：↑ / ↓（任务表中）; 操作：选择任务"
msgstr "Shortcut: ↑ / ↓ (in the task table); Action: Select Task"

msgid "快捷键：空格 / Delete（任务表中）; 操作：切换完成状态 / 删除"
msgstr ""
"Shortcut: Space / Delete (in the task table); Action: Toggle Completion / "
"Delete"

msgid "快捷键：F1; 操作：帮助"
msgstr "Shortcut: F1; Action: Help"

msgid "存储与边界"
msgstr "Storage and Boundaries"

msgid ""
"原生格式版本为 1，使用 ``RTDO`` 文件头、长度、CRC32 和有界字段。 最多 10,000 项任务、16 MiB 文档；标题 512 "
"字节、备注 64 KiB、项目 128 字节、 标签 512 字节、清单标题 256 字节。所有文字校验 UTF-8；日期是 1900–9999 年 "
"公历 ``YYYY-MM-DD``，可留空。日期筛选按系统本地日期计算。"
msgstr ""
"Native format version 1 uses an ``RTDO`` header, length, CRC32, and bounded "
"fields. Limits are 10,000 tasks and a 16 MiB document; titles 512 bytes, "
"notes 64 KiB, projects 128 bytes, tags 512 bytes, and list titles 256 bytes."
" All text is validated as UTF-8. Dates are optional Gregorian ``YYYY-MM-DD``"
" in years 1900–9999. Date filters use the system's local date."

msgid ""
"文件读取、目标检查与原子保存由独立工作进程完成。GUI 以非阻塞管道分批读取结果； "
"写入使用同目录私有临时文件，处理短读写，同步文件后原子替换并同步目录。 保存前用内容摘要与文件状态检测外部修改冲突；失败时保留当前文档。 "
"不支持符号链接文件、符号链接父目录或含 ``..`` 的路径。"
msgstr ""
"A separate worker handles reading, target checks, and atomic saving. The GUI"
" reads results in batches through nonblocking pipes. Writes use private "
"same-directory temporary files, handle short reads/writes, sync the file, "
"atomically replace the target, and sync the directory. Content digests and "
"file status detect external modification conflicts before saving; failures "
"preserve the current document. Symbolic-link files, symbolic-link parent "
"directories, and paths containing ``..`` are unsupported."

msgid ""
"保存时在目标目录使用稳定的 ``.relieftodo-save.lock`` 普通文件，权限为 0600、所有者 为当前用户；独占锁使多个 "
"ReliefTodo 实例的检查和替换操作互斥，繁忙时提示稍后重试。 锁文件不包含任务内容，保存结束后自动释放锁，保留文件以免产生不同锁 inode "
"的竞态。 ``.relieftodo-save.lock`` （包括仅大小写不同的写法）为保留文件名，不能作为保存或导出目标。 "
"这属于应用间协作锁；不遵守锁协议的其他程序仍可能在最后替换的瞬间并发改写目标。 ReliefNT 当前在 FAT32 "
"上可能把空普通文件识别为相同的锁对象，因此覆盖既有空文件时 可能保守地提示锁冲突；选择尚不存在的新文件名即可绕开。此限制不会覆盖原数据， 本次 QEMU"
" 运行验收使用系统根文件系统，未完成 FAT32/exFAT 的运行验收。"
msgstr ""
"Saving uses a stable regular file ``.relieftodo-save.lock`` in the target "
"directory, owned by the current user with mode 0600. An exclusive lock "
"serializes checks and replacement among ReliefTodo instances, with a retry-"
"later message when busy. The lock file contains no task data; the lock is "
"released automatically after saving, but the file remains to avoid races "
"involving different lock inodes. ``.relieftodo-save.lock``, including case-"
"only variants, is reserved and cannot be a save/export target. This is a "
"cooperative application lock; programs ignoring the protocol can still "
"rewrite the target concurrently at final replacement. ReliefNT on FAT32 may "
"currently identify empty regular files as the same lock object, "
"conservatively reporting a lock conflict when replacing an existing empty "
"file. Choose a new nonexistent filename to work around this. The limitation "
"does not overwrite original data. This QEMU runtime acceptance used the "
"system root filesystem; FAT32/exFAT runtime acceptance is incomplete."

msgid "本版不包含云同步、邮件通知、后台闹钟、周期任务、CSV 导入或跨设备协作。 没有自动保存或崩溃恢复；请主动保存清单。"
msgstr ""
"This version has no cloud synchronization, email notifications, background "
"alarms, recurring tasks, CSV import, or cross-device collaboration. There is"
" no autosave or crash recovery; save lists explicitly."
